                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d434-f2" n="91" xml:id="d434-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see memorandum by the Ambassador in Japan, November 10, 1941,
                        <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_710">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 710</ref>.</p>
            </note>
